diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index b6f5189..b1a91f0 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -4,6 +4,15 @@ libkscreen is the screen management library for KDE Plasma Workspaces. Its prima
 
 libkscreen is part of [Plasma releases][plasma-releases].
 
+## Native NWin integration
+
+The `nwin-libkscreen` build keeps the public KScreen library ABI and published
+Wayland output protocols. Its Wayland tablet-mode client uses
+`org.kde.NWin.TabletModeManager` at `/org/kde/NWin`. `kscreen-doctor`
+resolves `output.activeOutput` through `org.kde.NWin` at `/NWin` on Wayland;
+the independent X11 platform still uses its KWin service.
+
+
 ## End user
 Since this is a development library end users should instead look for support directly for the apps using this library. Please contact the support channels of your Linux distribution first. In case you find a bug in KScreen or if the bug is traced back to libkscreen, you can report it at the KDE [bug tracker][bug-tracker] (first look for duplicates).
 
